   "text": "At the same time, noble Avalokiteśvara, the bodhisattva and great being, beheld the practice of the profound perfection of wisdom, And saw that the five aggregates are empty of nature."
  },
  "2-1": {
   "source": {
    "file": "openpecha:MrsRfx7ML8QZxQPnhGesn",
